\pard\plain 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Functions for creating and managing XLIO sockets. \par
}{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
XLIO sockets are high-performance TCP socket abstractions that provide zero-copy capabilities. They are represented by opaque handles rather than file descriptors. \par
