\pard\plain 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Callback functions for handling socket events. \par
}{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
The XLIO Ultra API uses callbacks to notify applications of various events including connection state changes, data arrival, and completion of zero-copy operations.\par
Most of the callbacks are expected from the {\field {\*\fldinst { HYPERLINK  \\l "AAAAAAAAAK" }{}}{\fldrslt {\cs37\ul\cf2 xlio_poll_group_poll()}}} context. \par
}{\pard\widctlpar\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brsp20 \adjustright \par}
